00:04:40,909 --> 00:04:46,909
Our Leaders. Ourselves.

2
00:09:21,818 --> 00:09:27,818
The Queen is a drama, history film directed by Stephen Frears.

3
00:14:02,727 --> 00:14:08,727
The Queen is an intimate behind the scenes glimpse at the interaction between HM Elizabeth II and Prime Minister Tony Blair during their struggle, following the
death of Diana, to reach a compromise between what was a private tragedy for the Royal family and the public's demand for an overt display of mourning.

4
00:18:43,636 --> 00:18:49,636
The Queen, played by Helen Mirren.

5
00:23:24,545 --> 00:23:30,545
Tony Blair, played by Michael Sheen.

6
00:28:05,454 --> 00:28:11,454
Prince Philip, played by James Cromwell.

7
00:32:46,363 --> 00:32:52,363
Cherie Blair, played by Helen McCrory.

8
00:37:27,272 --> 00:37:33,272
Prince Charles, played by Alex Jennings.

9
